# SPDX-License-Identifier: PMPL-1.0-or-later
# Mustfile — Physical State Contract
# Author: Jonathan D.A. Jewell <j.d.a.jewell@open.ac.uk>

@abstract:
Physical state invariants for the developer-ecosystem monorepo.
These MUST be true for the repo to be in a valid state.
@end

## Structure

### ai-manifest-present
- description: 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml exists at repo root
- run: test -f 0-AI-MANIFEST.a2ml
- severity: critical

### machine-readable-dir
- description: .machine_readable/6a2/ directory exists with checkpoint files
- run: test -f .machine_readable/6a2/STATE.a2ml && test -f .machine_readable/6a2/META.a2ml && test -f .machine_readable/6a2/ECOSYSTEM.a2ml
- severity: critical

### license-present
- description: LICENSE file exists
- run: test -f LICENSE
- severity: critical

### security-policy
- description: SECURITY.md exists
- run: test -f SECURITY.md
- severity: critical

### editorconfig
- description: .editorconfig exists
- run: test -f .editorconfig
- severity: warning

## Language Policy

### no-typescript
- description: No TypeScript files in source directories
- run: "! find . -name '*.ts' -not -path '*/node_modules/*' -not -path '*/.lake/*' -not -path '*/opam-repository/*' 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: warning

### no-npm-lockfile
- description: No package-lock.json (use Deno)
- run: test ! -f package-lock.json
- severity: warning

## Monorepo Integrity

### no-nested-git
- description: No .git directories in subdirectories (monorepo rule)
- run: "! find . -mindepth 2 -name '.git' -type d -not -path '*/node_modules/*' -not -path '*/.lake/*' -not -path '*/opam-repository/*' -not -path '*/satellites/*' 2>/dev/null | head -1 | grep -q ."
- severity: warning

### spdx-headers
- description: Source files have SPDX license headers
- run: "find v-ecosystem/v_api_interfaces -name '*.v' -exec head -1 {} \\; 2>/dev/null | grep -c 'SPDX' | xargs test 0 -lt"
- severity: warning

## Workflows

### workflows-present
- description: GitHub Actions workflows directory exists
- run: test -d .github/workflows
- severity: warning

### hypatia-scan
- description: Hypatia scan workflow present
- run: test -f .github/workflows/hypatia-scan.yml
- severity: warning
